eir nose at all times but your mind  just blocks it out for you it's kind of  the same effect on the m2 macbook air  especially since it only takes up the  space that's used by the menu bar and  disappears completely when in full  screen mode and of course the biggest  benefit of all from that notch is the  1080p webcam that not only matches the  higher end 14 and 16 inch macbook pros  but it looks slightly better because of  the updated image signal processor and  other optimizations i also like how  apple is so confident in their branding  an image that they don't even need this  laptop to say macbook air anywhere on  the device not even on the bottom it's  so iconic that you can't mistake it for  any other laptop because no other  company could achieve this thin design  and performance combo in a laptop kind  of like no other company can achieve the  reliability and speed of our sponsor  nordvpn which is essentially a service  that encrypts your internet traffic on  every major platform to protect your  precious internet browsing data and your  ip address with just one click or even  zero clicks if you choose the auto  connect option and not only that but  while you're enjoying safe and private  browsing nord's threat protection  feature is blocking intrusive ads web  trackers and malicious malware and as a  bonus nord allows you to create an  encrypted connection from another  country to unlock content like movies  shows and games that aren't available in  the country you're living in seriously  some people get nordvpn just for that  feature alone and it's also the best vpn  out there thanks to having over 5400  servers in 59 countries which is why  it's also the fastest vpn out there so  protect your internet browsing today  with nordvpn by clicking the link below  to save on a north vpn plan with a 30  day money back guarantee now getting  back to the macbook air i absolutely  love the mac safe 3 charging feature  especially since it supports fast  charging an